This directory contains example data and command lines for running `mural_snv` and `mural_indel`.
- The `snv` folder contains `mural_snv` examples
- The `indel` folder contains `mural_indel` examples

Recurrent mutation example data
-------------------------------
The `recurrent_training.sorted.bed` and `recurrent_validation.sorted.bed` files
in `snv/data/` are synthetic recurrent mutation BED files generated from the
standard training and validation files via `generate_recurrent_data.py`. They are
provided for demonstration purposes only and do not represent real biological data.